MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The SanDisk microSD card fits my repeated purchases of memory cards, and its adapter would work with the card reader I already bought.",
    "The HDMI cable fits my pattern of buying practical connection accessories, and its extra length could help connect equipment around my TV."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo speakers, smart display, and smart plug introduce voice assistance or automation needs I do not currently have; buying power strips does not mean I want smart-home controls.",
    "The streaming sticks do not address an immediate need, and 4K capability adds little for my recorded 720p TV. The larger Fire tablet also lacks a clear purpose when I already have a Fire 7 and its case."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire tablet purchase seems to have been taken as broad interest in Amazon devices, although it does not explain a need for Alexa speakers or displays.",
    "Owning a TV and buying playback equipment seems to have been taken as interest in streaming, rather than a reason to look at the specific connections and accessories I use."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated purchases of memory cards, card storage, and a card reader show an ongoing storage need that matters more to me than adding another electronic device.",
    "My history includes many tripods, mounts, cables, and other supporting accessories. Compatibility with equipment I already own is a stronger reason to choose something than newer features alone."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my storage and connection needs but read my device purchases as interest in a broader Amazon and Alexa setup."
}
